@startuml
title SplitSmart System Context (approved initial scope)
left to right direction
actor "Account holder / group member" as User
actor "Group manager / approver" as Manager
package "SplitSmart desktop application\nJava 21 modular monolith" as SplitSmart {
  component "Java Swing UI" as UI
  component "Application + domain" as Core
  database "SQLite via JDBC" as DB
  UI --> Core : commands / queries
  Core --> DB : repositories
}
cloud "Email service (TBD)" as Email
User --> UI : uses desktop client
Manager --> UI : manages group / reviews expenses
Core ..> Email : future adapter only\n(channel not selected)
note bottom of SplitSmart
  Web, Android and iOS remain customer requirements.
  They are not delivered by Swing and need a separately
  approved shared backend/client design.
end note
@enduml
